-- One-time seed of real Dutch supermarkets (statiegeld collection points).
-- Sourced from live OpenStreetMap data via Nominatim (nominatim.openstreetmap.org),
-- collected because the public Overpass API mirrors this app normally queries were
-- unreachable at the time. Real names/addresses/coordinates; accepted_materials and
-- machine_count are defaults (PET+Alu is the legal minimum for these chains under NL
-- statiegeld law; exact machine counts per branch are not known and default to 1),
-- matching the same defaults the app already uses for Overpass-derived stores.
-- INSERT IGNORE + the unique constraint on `address` make this safe to re-run.

